WEBVTT

00:01:41.410 --> 00:01:42.920
Morning, old man, Nishi!

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:46.880
Well, what'd you think? Me hitting the sandbag?

00:01:46.880 --> 00:01:48.540
It's been a while, huh?

00:01:49.250 --> 00:01:50.300
Joe...

00:01:51.630 --> 00:01:56.430
It really does feel great, putting on the gloves and practicing first thing in the morning!

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:06.820
Old man, I guess spring's come to Tange Gym now that Joe's back!

00:02:14.140 --> 00:02:14.880
Morning!

00:02:14.880 --> 00:02:16.150
Oh, look, he's at it already!

00:02:20.620 --> 00:02:21.870
Well, whaddya know?

00:02:21.870 --> 00:02:26.430
Just seeing him practice like this makes it feel like he's really back!

00:02:26.430 --> 00:02:27.320
You said it.

00:02:27.320 --> 00:02:29.060
"Returnee Joe's Comeback Training."

00:02:29.060 --> 00:02:30.670
That'll be tomorrow's headline for sure!

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:33.380
Joe!

00:02:34.050 --> 00:02:35.930
Hey, it's you guys!

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:36.880
<i>Joe! Let's play!</i>

00:02:37.470 --> 00:02:40.430
Mind if we get a shot of you, Yabuki-kun?

00:02:40.430 --> 00:02:44.040
Oh, you guys sure are here early!
You must be dedicated!

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:45.160
A photo, huh?

00:02:45.160 --> 00:02:47.390
Well, if you want a photo, how's this for a cool pose?

00:02:47.920 --> 00:02:49.730
He's so cool!

00:02:50.150 --> 00:02:52.440
Can't you kids keep it down?

00:02:53.110 --> 00:02:56.980
Now, as for you reporters, don't you think it's a little early to be reporting?

00:02:57.610 --> 00:03:02.130
Oh, come on, old man! They've all come to celebrate my comeback!

00:03:02.130 --> 00:03:02.780
Ain't that right?

00:03:03.220 --> 00:03:06.620
Well, y-yes, of course, but there's one other thing.

00:03:08.230 --> 00:03:09.540
One other thing?

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:12.330
We want to know what's happened to the strength of your punch.

00:03:14.310 --> 00:03:20.040
Since you're making a comeback after such a long absence, and all...

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:30.640
All right, I'll give you proof that Yabuki Joe hasn't changed a lick!

00:04:02.820 --> 00:04:06.310
You want to talk about the transfer of Shiraki Gym?

00:04:06.920 --> 00:04:09.860
Yes. The same deal we discussed the other day?

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:13.020
Exactly.

00:04:16.100 --> 00:04:18.700
Whatever the case, it's all over now.

00:04:21.500 --> 00:04:23.970
I'm leaving it all in your hands.

00:04:26.080 --> 00:04:26.880
Goodbye, then.

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:33.710
Yoko?

00:05:10.730 --> 00:05:13.540
C'mon, Nishi! You seem to have improved a lot,

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:16.000
so why don't you be my sparring partner?

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:21.030
What are you thinking?

00:05:21.030 --> 00:05:23.510
How many days do you think you've been gone from the ring, Joe?

00:05:24.340 --> 00:05:28.600
Those reporters aren't the only ones who want to know what's happened to my punch!

00:05:28.600 --> 00:05:30.850
C'mon, Nishi! Are you gonna spar with me or not!?

00:05:33.730 --> 00:05:34.740
All right.

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:39.940
But, Joe, you gonna be okay? You just got back and all...{flows w/ comma}

00:05:40.420 --> 00:05:41.460
Nishi...

00:05:43.250 --> 00:05:44.940
Old man, you mind ringing the bell for us?

00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:50.700
Nishi, coming off his winning streak, against Yabuki, who hasn't trained at all.

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:53.120
This is starting to get interesting.

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:57.590
You almost ready, Mr. Mammoth?

00:05:57.590 --> 00:05:58.390
Yeah.

00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:00.000
Ready.

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:02.250
All right, old man! Let's hear the bell!

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:05.360
Okay. Go ahead.

00:06:05.360 --> 00:06:09.390
But no media photos!

00:06:09.770 --> 00:06:13.440
I'll okay it as long as this is a private sparring session!

00:06:24.270 --> 00:06:25.780
Come on, Nishi! What's the matter?

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:27.650
Hit me, will ya? Hit me!

00:06:43.180 --> 00:06:44.090
How was that, Joe?

00:06:48.620 --> 00:06:53.100
I see now. No wonder you won two straight matches by KO.

00:06:53.400 --> 00:06:56.850
You're nothing like the Nishi that snuck out to eat udon, huh?

00:07:07.620 --> 00:07:09.490
Joe! You all right?

00:07:09.910 --> 00:07:12.700
What's with this? It's like he's toying with a baby!

00:07:13.830 --> 00:07:15.020
Wh-What's the matter with you, Joe?

00:07:15.020 --> 00:07:16.370
Why won't you put your hands up?

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:17.700
Why won't you hit back?

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:20.960
Stop this, Nishi! Joe's at his breaking point!

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:23.750
No, not yet...

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:26.760
You're in no condition to spar, you idiot!

00:07:26.760 --> 00:07:27.920
Quit it already!

00:07:28.470 --> 00:07:30.620
Just shut up, will you?

00:07:30.620 --> 00:07:31.930
Not a word from you, either, Nishi!

00:07:32.540 --> 00:07:34.180
C'mon! Hit me!

00:07:34.550 --> 00:07:37.760
Hit you? You think I'll do that?

00:07:38.690 --> 00:07:41.770
It ain't sparring if I just hit a defenseless opponent!

00:07:41.770 --> 00:07:44.340
That ain't no different from hitting a sandbag!

00:07:44.340 --> 00:07:45.710
I quit!

00:07:49.130 --> 00:07:50.080
Hold it.

00:07:56.670 --> 00:07:58.720
P-Please, Nishi.

00:07:58.720 --> 00:08:00.410
Please hit me.

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:04.840
I want to get over it all.

00:08:05.760 --> 00:08:08.230
There's so much that's been clogged in my head,

00:08:08.230 --> 00:08:09.420
about Wolf,

00:08:09.420 --> 00:08:10.920
about Rikiishi...

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:13.760
I just want to get over it all now!

00:08:13.760 --> 00:08:15.300
That's why I want you to hit me!

00:08:15.300 --> 00:08:17.140
Please, hit me, Nishi!

00:08:17.140 --> 00:08:17.800
Please!

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:28.410
Well, Joe, I guess you're really serious about making a comeback!

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:31.690
Okay, here I come!

00:08:32.340 --> 00:08:34.700
I ain't holdin' anything back!

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:36.620
So don't come cryin' to me if you die!

00:08:54.950 --> 00:08:55.970
Joe...

00:09:02.500 --> 00:09:04.110
I've finally gotten over it, Nishi.

00:09:05.630 --> 00:09:07.440
C'mon, Joe. Hit me.

00:09:10.210 --> 00:09:12.270
Get up and hit me, Joe!

00:09:12.270 --> 00:09:14.190
You don't have to tell me!{fight animation so good}

00:09:48.270 --> 00:09:49.190
Nishi!

00:09:50.810 --> 00:09:52.320
Nishi, are you okay?

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:53.660
Hang in there, Nishi!

00:09:54.490 --> 00:09:56.000
Sorry about that, Nishi.

00:09:56.740 --> 00:09:57.820
That was my fault.

00:10:05.610 --> 00:10:07.750
Th-This is nothing-

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:10.280
is what I'd like to say...

00:10:11.190 --> 00:10:15.630
But that hurt like hell! Your punches are impressive as ever, Joe!{merged by editor}

00:10:20.180 --> 00:10:21.640
Did you see that, reporters?

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:25.640
The derelict Joe has finally made his comeback!

00:10:26.150 --> 00:10:28.640
Joe the Wild has finally gotten back on his feet!

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:32.290
Hooray for Bro Joe!

00:10:32.650 --> 00:10:35.780
No point in raising a fuss about it here, old man!

00:10:36.820 --> 00:10:40.810
The proof of my comeback has got to be in the ring, surrounded by the audience!

00:10:40.810 --> 00:10:45.840
Exactly! You showed us some amazing attacks against Nishi, who's nearly twice your weight!

00:10:45.840 --> 00:10:48.160
Why don't you try fighting a match right away?

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:51.790
Coach, we've got all the pictures we need, so we'll be behind him all the way!

00:10:52.170 --> 00:10:54.070
The reporters are right!

00:10:54.070 --> 00:10:58.050
We should contact the other gyms and see if any of them have the balls to fight me!

00:10:58.050 --> 00:10:58.800
Right, old man?

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:00.800
Joe, you son of a...

00:11:01.480 --> 00:11:03.760
I could fight every day if I had to.

00:11:04.070 --> 00:11:06.120
Y-You're getting cocky now!

00:11:06.120 --> 00:11:07.520
Just leave it all to me!

00:11:12.490 --> 00:11:13.920
Why, you...

00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:22.820
You haven't changed at all, you little bastard!

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:35.300
You little...

00:11:48.950 --> 00:11:50.350
I'm sure...

00:11:50.350 --> 00:11:52.830
I'm sure that Joe's punches are no different from before.

00:11:53.570 --> 00:11:54.690
But...

00:12:04.490 --> 00:12:07.630
Joe... Joe never hit me anywhere but my stomach!

00:12:09.010 --> 00:12:10.160
Nishi!

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:13.000
What're you doing out there? It's dinner time!

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:21.840
Hey, what's wrong, Nishi? Has our sparring left you so tired you lost your appetite?

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:24.180
So much for your two consecutive KOs!

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:31.610
Joe only hit me in the stomach!

00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:33.350
It can't be...

00:12:34.070 --> 00:12:36.790
Joe can't have...

00:12:57.630 --> 00:12:59.460
What're you doing there, Nishi?

00:13:00.600 --> 00:13:04.300
Skip practice and you only hurt yourself!

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:51.640
Joe...

00:13:56.050 --> 00:13:59.020
Nishi, is something the matter?

00:13:59.020 --> 00:14:01.110
Your face has looked strange lately.

00:14:01.420 --> 00:14:04.110
Joe, will you spar with me again?

00:14:04.710 --> 00:14:05.610
Nishi!

00:14:06.880 --> 00:14:08.440
Come on, why can't we?

00:14:08.440 --> 00:14:09.110
One more time!

00:14:09.820 --> 00:14:11.120
You must be joking!

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:13.330
You want me to make you keel over in pain again?

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:16.100
You're way better off hitting the sandbag!

00:14:16.100 --> 00:14:19.030
Besides, you got an important match ahead of you!

00:14:19.030 --> 00:14:20.880
And with Joe recovered like he is now...

00:14:21.330 --> 00:14:24.340
Joe, I really want to win this upcoming match!

00:14:24.340 --> 00:14:27.760
So I need to train myself so I won't collapse from any punch!

00:14:27.760 --> 00:14:29.430
Please, I'm begging you!

00:14:33.430 --> 00:14:36.430
Okay, Nishi. If you want it that bad, I'll spar with you.

00:14:38.310 --> 00:14:40.440
But you better know I ain't gonna hold back!

00:14:41.980 --> 00:14:42.900
All right.

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:23.690
Nishi! Your face is wide open!

00:15:42.630 --> 00:15:44.170
That was pathetic, Nishi!

00:15:44.170 --> 00:15:46.710
You'd better be able to last longer if you wanna win your next match!

00:15:48.990 --> 00:15:51.970
Are you okay? Hang in there, Nishi!

00:15:52.850 --> 00:15:55.140
See, I told you, idiot!

00:15:55.140 --> 00:15:56.680
I can see why you're impatient with him.

00:15:56.680 --> 00:15:58.980
He can't go toe-to-toe with me, right?

00:16:00.860 --> 00:16:05.280
Well, it's not like anyone can go toe-to-toe with you now.

00:16:05.280 --> 00:16:08.210
Right, that's all for practice today! Nishi, go wash your face!

00:16:19.420 --> 00:16:21.200
Joe! Where are you going?

00:16:22.380 --> 00:16:24.750
I couldn't get any roadwork done during the day.

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:26.170
So I'm going for a bit of a run.

00:16:29.760 --> 00:16:30.760
Joe!

00:16:33.390 --> 00:16:36.920
It's not just his punches! His fight's back in him too!

00:16:36.920 --> 00:16:38.850
He's just the way he was before!

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:41.560
Joe the Wild has really come back!

00:16:49.130 --> 00:16:52.420
Old man, I think you're celebrating... a little too soon.{added alpha}

00:16:52.420 --> 00:16:54.360
Old man, I think you're celebrating... a little too soon.

00:16:54.360 --> 00:16:55.450
What?

00:16:56.100 --> 00:16:58.200
Joe's punches are alive, no doubt.

00:16:59.880 --> 00:17:03.450
But during our past two sparring matches,

00:17:03.450 --> 00:17:05.460
he only went for my stomach.

00:17:05.780 --> 00:17:06.930
Only your stomach?{changed Actor from Nishi to Danpei}

00:17:06.930 --> 00:17:07.670
Yeah.{added by ninjacloud}

00:17:10.420 --> 00:17:13.470
So what if he only attacked your stomach, Nishi?

00:17:16.510 --> 00:17:19.930
I heard he took down that brawler with only body shots, too.

00:17:20.390 --> 00:17:25.060
So you're saying you're not the only one with whom Joe only used body blows?

00:17:25.060 --> 00:17:29.980
But Nishi, so what if he only attacked your stomach?{flows w/o comma}

00:17:31.780 --> 00:17:34.450
What's so bad about Joe only throwing body blows!?

00:17:38.780 --> 00:17:41.080
Just... body blows?

00:17:41.840 --> 00:17:43.000
That's right.

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:46.960
Body blows... That means...

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:50.040
H-He can't be...

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:54.800
That's right, old man. Joe's too scared to hit anyone in the face.

00:17:56.520 --> 00:18:01.970
The blow he gave to Rikiishi's temple was what caused his death!

00:18:01.970 --> 00:18:06.560
And that fear has subconsciously turned Joe into a body-blow-only boxer!

00:18:10.270 --> 00:18:12.110
Damn it all...

00:18:13.270 --> 00:18:17.920
Nishi! Did you challenge Joe today so you could test that? Huh!?

00:18:24.560 --> 00:18:26.870
Joe's too scared to hit anyone in the face!

00:18:28.830 --> 00:18:30.160
That can't be!

00:18:30.160 --> 00:18:31.380
It's just a coincidence!

00:18:40.180 --> 00:18:42.640
Just a coincidence that Joe only attacked your...

00:18:59.650 --> 00:19:02.820
Nishi! Don't you dare tell anyone about this!

00:19:03.690 --> 00:19:06.410
If the boxing world knows about this, then Joe...

00:19:07.730 --> 00:19:11.830
You better not tell anyone about Joe, no matter what!

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:14.210
Right, got it.{needs retiming - start after "huh" sound}

00:19:18.380 --> 00:19:19.960
Because if that's true...

00:19:20.810 --> 00:19:21.680
Then Joe...

00:19:22.440 --> 00:19:23.720
Joe's...

00:19:26.270 --> 00:19:29.190
That bastard's done for!

00:20:09.220 --> 00:20:11.330
And he was finally gonna make a comeback...

00:20:11.330 --> 00:20:16.150
I guess Joe really is an unlucky guy...

00:20:19.160 --> 00:20:23.200
But he's gonna have to fight someone one of these days!

00:20:25.750 --> 00:20:29.880
Besides, we won't know for sure whether or not he's done for

00:20:29.880 --> 00:20:32.810
until he gets in the ring!

00:20:37.250 --> 00:20:39.140
He's a wild beast!

00:20:39.560 --> 00:20:41.970
That's right! Logic means nothing to him!

00:20:42.320 --> 00:20:44.320
He's got his wild instincts!

00:20:44.320 --> 00:20:48.720
I'm gonna bet on his first comeback match!

00:21:25.100 --> 00:21:29.600
Yoko, will you come over here and help me sort this paperwork?

00:21:30.360 --> 00:21:31.110
Yes.

00:21:41.610 --> 00:21:44.570
I'm really sorry to have to ask this of you, young lady.

00:21:45.490 --> 00:21:51.080
No, it's fine. Now I can forget all about Shiraki Gym.

00:22:08.470 --> 00:22:10.680
Yabuki-kun has a match at eight tonight?

00:22:11.090 --> 00:22:14.900
Yes. That invitation was sent to me yesterday.

00:22:14.900 --> 00:22:17.690
But I no longer have any use for it.

00:22:23.270 --> 00:22:25.860
Y-Yoko, you can't be thinking...

00:22:32.010 --> 00:22:33.660
Wait, Yoko!

00:22:35.130 --> 00:22:37.770
You are the only heir of the Shiraki magnate.

00:22:38.290 --> 00:22:44.060
A sheltered young woman like you has no place sitting at the masculine ringside!

00:22:44.060 --> 00:22:45.420
Forget about boxing and...

00:22:45.420 --> 00:22:46.800
Just let me go tonight!

00:22:46.800 --> 00:22:47.820
Yoko!

00:22:49.300 --> 00:22:52.270
This is Yabuki Joe's first comeback match!

00:22:52.270 --> 00:22:54.580
I want to stand witness to it in Rikiishi's place!

