The morning sun rises upon the hearts of men!

00:24:46.830 --> 00:24:48.710
It's Joe's first comeback match!

00:24:48.710 --> 00:24:51.410
Joe's eyes shine, and his beastly blood boils!

00:24:51.410 --> 00:24:55.180
He throws intense body blows and killer punches!

00:24:55.180 --> 00:24:58.140
But Joe can only aim for the body!

00:24:58.140 --> 00:25:00.890
My and Nishi's unease only grows larger!

00:25:01.400 --> 00:25:06.710
Now, as Joe stands in the ring once more for his first comeback match,

00:25:06.710 --> 00:25:08.320
which way is tomorrow!?
